{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19052","headline":"和西川李尚书汉州微月游房太尉西湖 · 刘禹锡","name":"和西川李尚书汉州微月游房太尉西湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木落汉川夜，西湖悬玉鈎。\n旌旗环水次，舟檝泛中流。\n目极想前事，神交如共游。\n瑶琴久已绝，松韵自悲秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}